<title>USA: Hickok sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Hickok sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hickok Inc said it declared a special dividend of $0.20 per share for both its Class A and Class B common shares, payable January 24, record January 3.</p>
</text>
